  (descr "The driver module's own pins: 16 plated holes at exactly the controller's Pololu_G2_18v17 socket positions (1x8 logic row GND DIR PWM SLP FLT CS 3V3 VM at x -15.24; GND OUTB OUTA VIN pairs at x +12.70), 1.02 mm drill, 1.7 mm pads, pin 1 (VIN) square. Origin = board centre; outline 33.02 x 20.32 mm on F.Fab. Male 2.54 mm pins point down into the controller's 1x8 female strips.")
